## 11. Code examples

### Check a UI window

```csharp
// Check whether a specific window is open
if ([UIManager].instance.[window].activeSelf)
{
    // Window is open
}
```

### Read player data

```csharp
var player = [Player].instance;
// Spoken text always goes through a LocalizationKey with {0} placeholders
string health = LocalizationUtils.Format(LocalizationKey.[HEALTH_FORMAT], player.[health], player.[maxHealth]);
```

### Go through the inventory items

```csharp
foreach (var item in [Inventory].instance.[items])
{
    string info = LocalizationUtils.Format(LocalizationKey.[ITEM_COUNT_FORMAT], item.[name], item.[count]);
}
```

