### Harmony patch example

Hooks are nested classes inside the Accessible component that uses them (docs/03-architecture.md):

```csharp
[HarmonyPatch(typeof([Class]), "[Method]")]
private static class [Name]Hook
{
    private static void Postfix([Class] __instance)
    {
        // Runs after the original method; never let an exception reach the game
        AccessibilityMgr.Guard("[Component].[Name]Hook", () => { /* hand over to the component */ });
    }
}
```

